      "compound_name": "[MnIII2TbIII4(L1)2(L2)2(μ3-OH)4(μ1,3-pivalate)6(NO3)2]·2CH3CN",
      "formula": "[MnIII2TbIII4(L1)2(L2)2(μ3-OH)4(μ1,3-pivalate)6(NO3)2]·2CH3CN (C74H108N6O34Mn2Tb4; CCDC C70H102Mn2N4O34Tb4·2(C2H3N))",
