      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc susceptibility (2–300 K) and magnetization show significant anisotropy. Compound 1 is a field-induced weak SMM (no hysteresis at 1.8 K between ±6.5 T). Arrhenius fits of ac relaxation times give Ueff = 11.12 cm−1, τ0 = 1.04×10−7 s under 1000 Oe and Ueff = 10.42 cm−1, τ0 = 1.62×10−7 s under 3500 Oe. Cole–Cole plots fit a single generalized Debye process with α ≈ 0.23–0.31.",
        "measurements": [
